# Adding Cursor Rules
RULE: Use kebab-case names; follow structure (CRITICAL summary, DO/NEVER, Codex ref); don't duplicate codex.
WHY: Maintains workspace consistency; avoids rule bloat and conflicts.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/cursor-rules-system.md, unified-trading-pm/plans/ai/contexts/CODING_STANDARDS.md
DO: Reference codex; add to related rules; use compact format (10-20 lines)
NEVER: Duplicate codex content; use PascalCase; create generic rule names
